264 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The target group users are white-collar workers in professional, managerial, and administrative roles. We assume that these individuals deal with a high load of information during their initial weeks, leading to numerous questions. New joiners might hesitate to ask too many questions due to the new environment and desire to make a strong first impression, potentially fearing that frequent inquiries could reflect negatively on their qualifications.  )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
