274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This technical solution involves creating a chatbot that helps new employees learn about company policies by leveraging Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), Machine Learning for Recommendations, and Knowledge Graphs. The company's documentation is ingested into the system via an API and stored on our servers for training. The model absorbs the data and self-annotates the company information based on its initial training. It then compiles this data and accesses it via input data from the central database.  )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
