/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Data annotation will be crucial for training the models effectively in a two-step process. First manual annotation using human annotators label data based on predefined categories to create a high-quality training set. Then on new datasets the model can do automated annotation: As the model learns, it begins to self-annotate new data, reducing the need for manual intervention.  )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
