/E (Regarding storage, on-premises is challenging to implement; therefore, Alexander opts for the Cloud, since the use of AWS services will be instrumental. Such as using S3 for storage, Lambda/EC2 for processing and DynamoDB/RDS for metadata storage. There is the advantage and benefit of easy scalability through serverless architecture. Data encryption \(AWS KMS\) and role-based access control are the central points of the program. )
