/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (While Alexander is designed with the purpose of helping employees to better adapt to their new work environment, potential future expansions can be made for the app to better optimise in different work settings. Research conducted by the Office for National Statistics \(ONS\) found that after the covid pandemic, more than 50% of people living in London are working remotely outside of their office \(ONS, 2020\), indicating that remote work has now become a popular work culture. )
